{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2022-11-22 05:00:00', 'title': 'BZ GROUP AND BUNGE ENTER INTO STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--BZ GROUP AND BUNGE (NYSE: BG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE SIGNING OF A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP. AS PART OF THIS AGREEMENT, BUNGE ACQUIRES 49% OF BZ GROUP WHILE THE BEUZELIN FAMILY REMAINS THE MAJORITY SHAREHOLDER WITH 51% OWNERSHIP. THE TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS AND REGULATORY APPROVAL.'}